#19801
Pseudo-steps~
It seems someone has created a small passageway by forming steps out of the
hard soil.  You move closer to the stairwell and realize there has been a great
deal of effort put into reinforcing the walls and ceiling of the opening.  
There is a gentle glow from within the next room and you wonder what could lie
beyond this entrance that would require such a strong foundation.    
~
