#19802
The &04Purgatory&00~
   You have escaped damnation and made it to Purgatory, aplace where the
imperfections of your previous life are shed.  A lantern, hanging from the
ceiling, sways back and forth as a gust of wind accompanies you through the
entrance.  You gaze around and see no true boundaries to this dark passage.  
The light creeps towards you and then slowly stops and swings in the opposite
direction, revealing two villagers on either side of a stairwell.  They step
forward and you are startled by the soft &04blue&00 glow of their eyes fixed
upon yours.  These powerful wraiths were obviously put here to protect the
sacred den that lies beyond these steps.  Only through trust, dedication, and
satisfaction by works of The &04Elders&00, will you have the opportunity to
cross this plain of existence into the next.  Before long you will understand
the strength and importance of respect as you descend to the ethereal realm of
Genesis.    
~
