#19803
The Den of Elders~
   You take your first step into this room and are immediately overcome with
feelings of justification and triumph, as if youve proven your worth.  Unlit
torches begin burning in sequence around the den, one by one, and provide a
warm light that sooths your stirred mind.  You look around as the rooms
treasures become visible and first notice water rushing through a large cavity
in the ceiling.  You follow the steady flood with your eyes as it crashes into
a pool of water and forms a stream of pure water to the south.  Strange
markings, &04blue&00 and &14white&00 in color cover the walls and seem to dance
as the flames light bounces from wall to wall.  In the far corner rests a
monument of a bearded man holding a staff.    
~
