#19804
A &07Soothing Shadow&00~
   A strange feeling off separation fills this dreary, underground room, as if
separated from this plain of existence.  A magical presence can be felt and a
sense of belonging fills your mind as your eyes start to adjust to the
&07darkness&00.  Looking up to see a shimmering silhouette of the &07night&00
sky perplexes and intrigues your mind.  This image entices your once angered
and tired soul to take rest for the day, while the soft glowing of the moon
lightens the room ever so slightly.  A flicker in the &07shadows&00 catches
your eye and draws your attention away from the mystical ceiling for a moment.
Suddenly, you find yourself in the &07darkness&00 among comfortable sheets of
cotton.  A figure steps forth and whispers softly in your ear, Sleep now and
when you wake, you shall be reborn and refreshed as a new day waits.    
~
