#19805
The Abandoned Apothecary~
   Shelves, holding an endless amount of used and broken vials, cover the walls
in this ancient shop.  It is obvious that its owner has been missing for quite
some time.  As you browse the cluttered ledges for a useful elixir, you stumble
upon a large piece of material sprawled out on the cold floor.  You kneel down
to examine the mound of folded cloth and realize that the alchemist that once
owned this shop has left his cloak behind.    
~
