#19806
The &07Repository&00~
   A massive &07black&00 tear in reality writhes silently in the centre of this
room.  As you approach the tear in time and space, various items can be seen
flashing into different positions Surrounding this "&07black hole&00" are
strange markings engraved upon several stones.  One would assume these symbols
have been put into place by a powerful magical force to prevent this tear from
rupturing completely.  The outer layer of the room has been crafted from pure
mithril - melted and molded to ensure the security of its wealth.  This room
must hold the treasures and valuable items belonging to the fellowship that is
&04Genesis&00.  A true feeling of trust engulfs this room
~
