#19807
Within the &11Waterfall&00~
   You make your way through the relentless fury of falling &11water&00 into a
small cavern.  You move forward, careful to avoid the overwhelming amount of
stalactites.  As you glance to the right a small &11pond&00 reveals itself,
hidden behind the large rocks stretching towards the floor.  Big lily pads
shift themselves together to form a line, acting as stepping-stones to the
center of the &11pond&00.  You wonder if they could support your weight and
test one with the tip of your boot.  Your curiosity gets the best of you and
you carefully make your way across the &11pond&00.  As you reach the end of
these pads you kneel down to study the &11glassy surface&00.  Expecting to see
your own reflection you are shocked by the images of the familiar towns and
villages found across Raven.  You realize this must be a portal of some kind.
A &11frog&00 jumps from the &11water&00 and lands beside you.    
~
