#19808
Elysian Fields~
   An instant sensation of warmth, relaxation, and nirvana flows around your
body, flooding your mind with peaceful thoughts.  Glancing around this blessed
abode it seems endless.  Fields of tall green grass sway gently as the wind
brushes by.  A tall oak tree can be seen in the distance while white doves
circle its leaves.  Small animals run playfully past your feet to a stream
flowing from the north.  The warmth from the sunlight on the soft ground eases
the pain of your constant travels.  You decide to finally sit down and embrace
the peaceful atmosphere.  It slowly puts you into a hypnotic state as you close
your eyes and fall into a deep sleep.  For what seemed like only a short time
you awake and realize this has all been just a dream - but what a dream it was.
You feel vibrant and fully rejuvenated to head back out into the dangerous
world of Raven.    
~
