The &14Arcane Sanctuary&00~
   You march your way to the top of a polished, &14white&00 marble staircase.
You scan your surroundings and cautiously position yourself on an air-born
&14pedestal&00 just beyond the last step.  The fear of falling lessens as your
attention is veered towards something else - a large book hovering effortlessly
in the center of the &14pedestal&00.  Upon opening the book, torches on the
pillars placed along the circumference of the platform burst into flames.  The
area outside these columns seems to darken, leaving only you and the book
illuminated.  &14Star-like beacons&00 glimmer in the midst of the background of
space.  Few understand this place.    
~
