Hall of &08Heroes&00~
As you walk into this room, a sudden calm comes over you.  Looking around
it is obvious the owner of this room is highly respected, and likely
held dear by many.  Numerous large tapestries as well as several small
sculptures adorn the walls while in the center of the room is a perfect
replica of the great warrior Alak.  Adorned with the missing hero's
